// Core import helper (optional alias for your main AI call)
generateText = {import:ai-text-plugin}

// =========================
// Writing style families
// =========================
writingStyle
  creative and imaginative
  technical and precise
  poetic and lyrical
  persuasive and compelling
  academic and analytical
  casual and conversational
  dramatic and intense
  humorous and witty
  mysterious and atmospheric
  minimalist and stark
  journalistic and objective
  narrative and character-driven
  instructional and step-by-step
  reflective and introspective
  descriptive and sensory-rich
  experimental and unconventional
  corporate and formal
  marketing and sales-oriented
  legal and formalistic
  scientific and data-driven

// Optional: narrower style sublists (for presets)
writingStyle_narrative
  creative and imaginative
  narrative and character-driven
  dramatic and intense
  mysterious and atmospheric
  reflective and introspective

writingStyle_nonfiction
  technical and precise
  academic and analytical
  journalistic and objective
  scientific and data-driven
  instructional and step-by-step
  corporate and formal
  legal and formalistic

// =========================
// Tone controls
// =========================
toneModifier
  enthusiastic
  melancholic
  authoritative
  whimsical
  serious
  playful
  somber
  uplifting
  neutral
  sarcastic
  hopeful
  ominous
  compassionate
  detached
  inspirational
  cynical
  tense
  relaxed
  urgent

// Tone intensity (for extra nuance)
toneIntensity
  very subtle
  subtle
  moderate
  strong
  extremely strong

// =========================
// Length & structure
// =========================
lengthDirective
  Keep it ultra-brief (about 25 words).
  Keep it brief (about 50 words).
  Write a medium-length piece (about 150 words).
  Provide a detailed, comprehensive response (about 300 words).
  Write a long-form piece (about 600 words).
  Write an in-depth, exhaustive piece (about 1200 words).

lengthType
  one sentence
  short paragraph
  two to three paragraphs
  multi-section article
  long-form essay

// =========================
// POV, audience, format, complexity
// =========================
pointOfView
  First person ("I") perspective.
  Second person ("you") perspective.
  Third person limited perspective.
  Third person omniscient narrator.
  Mixed perspective with occasional shifts.

targetAudience
  Children around 8–12 years old.
  Teen and young adult readers.
  General adult audience.
  Non-expert readers with no prior knowledge.
  Domain experts and specialists.
  Busy executives and decision-makers.
  Hobbyists and enthusiasts.
  Academic readers and researchers.

formatType
  Standard prose paragraphs.
  Bullet-point list.
  Numbered step-by-step instructions.
  Dialogue-only scene.
  Internal monologue.
  Email message.
  Social media post.
  Product description.
  Technical documentation section.
  FAQ-style Q&A.
  Blog article.
  Press release.

complexityLevel
  Use very simple, accessible language.
  Use moderately technical language with light jargon.
  Use highly technical language with domain-specific jargon.
  Use a mix of simple and technical language.
  Explain complex ideas with clear analogies.

// =========================
// Constraints & extras
// =========================
styleConstraints
  Avoid using bullet points.
  Prefer short, punchy sentences.
  Prefer long, flowing sentences.
  Include at least one vivid metaphor.
  Include a surprising twist near the end.
  End with a clear call to action.
  End with a reflective question.
  Avoid rhetorical questions.
  Avoid first-person pronouns.
  Avoid second-person pronouns.
  Avoid clichés and overused phrases.
  Use present tense throughout.
  Use past tense throughout.

// =========================
// Main combined style prompt
// =========================
aiStylePrompt
  Style: [writingStyle]. Tone: [toneModifier], [toneIntensity]. [lengthDirective] Length type: [lengthType] Point of view: [pointOfView] Target audience: [targetAudience] Format: [formatType] Complexity: [complexityLevel] Additional constraints: [styleConstraints]

// A slightly shorter variant if you want less verbosity
aiStylePrompt_compact
  Style: [writingStyle]. Tone: [toneModifier]. [lengthDirective] POV: [pointOfView] Audience: [targetAudience] Format: [formatType].

// =========================
// Locked presets (named combos)
// =========================
preset_poeticShortMelancholic
  Style: poetic and lyrical. Tone: melancholic, subtle. Keep it brief (about 50 words). POV: First person ("I") perspective. Audience: General adult audience. Format: Standard prose paragraphs. Complexity: Use very simple, accessible language. Additional constraints: Include at least one vivid metaphor.

preset_techDocConciseNeutral
  Style: technical and precise. Tone: neutral, moderate. Keep it brief (about 50 words). POV: Third person limited perspective. Audience: Domain experts and specialists. Format: Technical documentation section. Complexity: Use highly technical language with domain-specific jargon. Additional constraints: Avoid metaphors and figurative language.

preset_marketingUpliftingMedium
  Style: marketing and sales-oriented. Tone: uplifting, strong. Write a medium-length piece (about 150 words). POV: Second person ("you") perspective. Audience: Busy executives and decision-makers. Format: Product description. Complexity: Use moderately technical language with light jargon. Additional constraints: End with a clear call to action.

preset_storyLongAtmospheric
  Style: narrative and character-driven. Tone: mysterious and atmospheric, strong. Write a long-form piece (about 600 words). POV: Third person limited perspective. Audience: General adult audience. Format: Standard prose paragraphs. Complexity: Use a mix of simple and technical language. Additional constraints: Include a surprising twist near the end.

preset_socialPostPlayfulUltraShort
  Style: casual and conversational. Tone: playful, strong. Keep it ultra-brief (about 25 words). POV: Second person ("you") perspective. Audience: Social media followers. Format: Social media post. Complexity: Use very simple, accessible language. Additional constraints: Prefer short, punchy sentences.

// =========================
// Example “ready-to-send” prompts
// =========================
aiPrompt_free
  [aiStylePrompt]
  Now write the response.

aiPrompt_withTopic
  [aiStylePrompt]
  Topic: [topic].

// topic is a helper list you can override in your own generator
topic
  Describe a city where gravity works sideways.
  Explain quantum computing to a curious teenager.
  Pitch a new fantasy novel about time-traveling cartographers.
  Summarize the benefits of test-driven development for a small startup.
